{
  "Version": "v23-reviewed-standard-size-20261112",
  "RuntimeRelease": "0.23.0-local.imitation.11",
  "Created": "2026-11-04",
  "Policy": "No automatic baseline refresh. Legacy modifications require explicit review and applicable regression, including Creo native tests for behavioral changes.",
  "ReviewedChanges": [
    "0.23.0-local.imitation.47: native_chat_ui.h adds a new BWTL-only menu item and appends its action ID, preserving existing actions.",
    "0.23.0-local.assemblylearning.60: adds one imitation menu action and learned assembly context, with the existing native model dispatch retained.",
    "0.23.0-preview.5: BWTL-only method-library status, verified workflow menu and chat intake. Existing menu action numbers and Creo command contracts remain compatible.",
    "0.23.0-local.assemblystudy.1: BWTL assembly learning menu adds one action ID. Chat routes only explicitly named actions; prior modeling and chat contracts are unchanged.",
    "0.23.0-local.orderrevision.1: Adds a BWTL-only order revision menu and explicit chat entry points.",
    "0.23.0-local.assemblyflow.1: Adds BWTL-only assembly flow commands and menu. Native placement continues through existing checked assembly rules.",
    "0.23.0-local.assemblyflow.2: Extends the BWTL-only assembly flow menu with measured hole groups and guarded fill of vacant stations.",
    "0.23.0-local.assemblyflow.3: BWTL-only branch testing and persistent resume commands use existing validated native assembly placement.",
    "0.23.0-local.standardinterface.1: Adds read-only native geometry measurement and BWTL-local standard interfaces, without changing CAD command contracts.",
    "0.23.0-local.standardinterface.2: Adds BWTL-only case scope, dated shop rules and read-only where-used reporting.",
    "0.23.0-local.standardinterface.3: Adds measured standard-variant reopen verification and native drawing-linked approval. Assembly trial requires a saved base.",
    "0.23.0-local.mountingplates.1: Adds BWTL-only native sheet mounting patterns using existing checked stock and cut APIs.",
    "0.23.0-local.cabinetparts.1 adds verified cabinet parts 012, 014, 018, 019 to BWTL local routing and the catalog.",
    "0.23.0-local.cabinetparts.2 adds tested feature 015 to the cabinet parts catalog.",
    "0.23.0-local.chatfacts.1 validates latest utterance, dialog context, native model facts and the loaded build inventory without adding roadmap features.",
    "0.23.0-local.defaultassembly.1 binds the live part before creating the target and verifies a native Creo Default placement.",
    "0.23.0-local.assemblypart.1 adds the native empty component command and routes explicit assembly child requests without opening a standalone part.",
    "Add Create New Project under Working Directory with full E-drive template copy and native Creo directory change",
    "Project creation uses the complete Windows folder name entered by the user",
    "Verified Creo assembly naming, multi-level creation, placement and native company camera rebuild",
    "Verified native menu organization with original action IDs and narrow layouts",
    "Verified independent model routing and native sheet metal plate creation",
    "Codex App Server resident chat and guarded BWTL dynamic tools",
    "Separate archived chat for each Creo process",
    "Monotonic per-command runtime display across local and resident task lifecycle",
    "Mixed chat attachments and read-only PDF, Creo and text analysis",
    "Company library tools, exact CAD source, and project output",
    "Open existing assembly components in verified native windows",
    "Create same-name assembly and sheet-metal child, then verify opened window",
    "Preserve supplied drawing number and revision for default parts",
    "Native flat sheet holes, precise verification failures and model-bound chat continuation",
    "Verified native return to containing assembly window",
    "Standard Files menu with eight existing fastener directories",
    "Inline model catalog in Standard Files fasteners menu",
    "Shared typed modeling rules and verified resumable blank-part workflow",
    "Collapsible fastener catalog group rows and navigation",
    "Scoped exact fastener lookup, read and view in Creo chat",
    "Persist owner-requested assembly experience and confirm file readback",
    "Assembly experience persistence and menu fastener open-save",
    "Prior chat and verified model creation evidence carried to follow-up prompts; same-session attachment context",
    "Resolve managed company library aliases and native BSO M3x6 read, project copy and single-batch placement",
    "Preview.6: public data-drive configuration and application-managed camera model manifest"
  ],
